{"id":"8b8709e6da133f0a","group":"28","path":"28/28-ex-palindrome-linear-time.md","title":"回文语言的线性时间算法","display":"ex-palindrome-linear-time — 回文语言的线性时间算法","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-ex-palindrome-linear-time","aliases":["28-ex-palindrome-linear-time"],"display":"ex-palindrome-linear-time — 回文语言的线性时间算法","depends_on":["[[28-df-dtime]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; Examples 1.1 and 1.4","source_printed_pages":"13–16","source_pdf_pages":"39–42","source_status":"statement-compared-local-proof-reviewed","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"local_proof_reviewed":true,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-ex-palindrome-linear-time"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-ex-palindrome-linear-time</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-palindrome-linear-time — 回文语言的线性时间算法"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9ed6fa1ce1934897\" href=\"?note=9ed6fa1ce1934897\" title=\"28-df-dtime\">28-df-dtime</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; Examples 1.1 and 1.4"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"13–16"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"39–42"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-proof-reviewed"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"local_proof_reviewed","html":"true"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PAL}\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*\">\\(\\mathrm{PAL}\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*\\)</span> 为本条构造的语言。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；字串下标从1开始，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon\">\\(\\varepsilon\\)</span> 为空串；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DTIME}\">\\(\\mathrm{DTIME}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9ed6fa1ce1934897\" href=\"?note=9ed6fa1ce1934897\" title=\"28-df-dtime\">28-df-dtime</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{rev}(x_1\\cdots x_n)\\coloneqq x_n\\cdots x_1,\\qquad\\operatorname{rev}(\\varepsilon)\\coloneqq\\varepsilon.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{rev}(x_1\\cdots x_n)\\coloneqq x_n\\cdots x_1,\\qquad\\operatorname{rev}(\\varepsilon)\\coloneqq\\varepsilon.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PAL}\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\Sigma^*:x=\\operatorname{rev}(x)\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{PAL}\\in\\mathrm{DTIME}(n\\mapsto n+1).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PAL}\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\Sigma^*:x=\\operatorname{rev}(x)\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{PAL}\\in\\mathrm{DTIME}(n\\mapsto n+1).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>复制输入到工作带；把工作头移到副本末端，再令输入头向右、工作头向左逐位比较。每阶段只扫描O(n)个格，发现不等立即拒绝，同时抵达两端则接受，空串接受。因工作带副本反向读取恰是rev(x)，算法的接受条件即所列集合。</p>\n<p>来源：用户所给 Arora–Barak PDF，Examples 1.1 and 1.4；印刷 pp.13–16 / PDF pp.39–42。本次核对范围：原书对应陈述及本注内所列论证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-dtime","status":"resolved","id":"9ed6fa1ce1934897","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-dtime]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-dtime","status":"resolved","id":"9ed6fa1ce1934897","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；字串下标从1开始，$\\varepsilon$ 为空串；$\\mathrm{DTIME}$ 见 [[28-df-dtime]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{PAL}\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varepsilon","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DTIME}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{rev}(x_1\\cdots x_n)\\coloneqq x_n\\cdots x_1,\\qquad\\operatorname{rev}(\\varepsilon)\\coloneqq\\varepsilon.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PAL}\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\Sigma^*:x=\\operatorname{rev}(x)\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{PAL}\\in\\mathrm{DTIME}(n\\mapsto n+1).","display":true}],"bytes":1630,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-271","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-ex-palindrome-linear-time]]、[[28-thm-binary-alphabet-simulation]]、[[28-thm-uncomputable-diagonal-language]]、[[28-df-halting-language]]、[[28-thm-halting-undecidability]]。"}],"outgoing":["9ed6fa1ce1934897"]}